---
    import MainLayout  from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

    <MainLayout>
        <main class="w-full min-h-screen bg-[#080d19] px-6 py-24">
            <section class="w-full max-300 mx-auto">
                <div class="text-center mb-12">
                    <p class="personajes-subtitle text-[#c9bafa] text-sm tracking-[0.3em] mb-3">
                        GRAND THEFT AUTO VI
                    </p>

                    <h1 class="personajes-title font-['Barlow_Condensed'] font-extrabold
                        text-4xl md:text-6xl text-[#ffe4a6] uppercase">
                        Conoce a los personajes
                    </h1>

                    <p class="text-[#c9bafa] mt-3 text-sm md:text-base">
                        Las historias que dan vida a Leonida.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="grid  grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
                    <article class="personaje-card relative  h-130 md:h-140 overflow-hidden rounded-xl">

                        <img 
                            src="/images/desktop/Boobie.jpg" 
                            alt="Boobie"
                            class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover
                            mask-[linear-gradient(to_bottom,black_0%,black_85%,transparent_100%)]"
                        >
                        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-[#b5a5e8]/90 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
                        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-black/70 via-transparent to-black/10"></div>
                        <div class="card-shine absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none"></div>
                        <div class="absolute bottom-10 left-4 right-4 text-center text-white">
                            <h2 class="font-extrabold text-2xl text-[#ffe4a6]">
                                BOOBIE IKE
                            </h2>
                            <p class="text-sm mt-2">
                                Una leyenda de Vice City que convirtió su pasado en las calles en un imperio de negocios, música y entretenimiento.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </article>

                    <article class="personaje-card relative h-130 md:h-140 overflow-hidden rounded-xl">

                        <img 
                            src="/images/desktop/Brian_Heder.jpg" 
                            alt="Brian"
                            class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover
                            mask-[linear-gradient(to_bottom,black_0%,black_85%,transparent_100%)]"
                        >
                        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-[#b5a5e8]/90 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
                        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-black/70 via-transparent to-black/10"></div>
                        <div class="card-shine absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none"></div>
                        <div class="absolute bottom-10 left-4 right-4 text-center text-white">
                            <h2 class="font-extrabold text-2xl text-[#ffe4a6]">
                                BRIAN HEDER
                            </h2>
                            <p class="text-sm mt-2">
                                Un veterano del contrabando que todavía mueve mercancía desde su astillero en los Cayos de Leonida.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </article>

                    <article class="personaje-card relative h-130 md:h-140 overflow-hidden rounded-xl">

                        <img 
                            src="/images/desktop/Jason_Lucia.jpg" 
                            alt="Jason_Lucia"
                            class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover
                            mask-[linear-gradient(to_bottom,black_0%,black_85%,transparent_100%)]"
                        >
                        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-[#b5a5e8]/90 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
                        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-black/70 via-transparent to-black/10"></div>
                        <div class="card-shine absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none"></div>
                        <div class="absolute bottom-10 left-4 right-4 text-center text-white">
                            <h2 class="font-extrabold text-2xl text-[#ffe4a6]">
                                 JASON Y LUCIA
                            </h2>
                            <p class="text-sm mt-2" >
                                Dos personas que buscan cambiar su destino, pero una operación fallida los arrastra a una peligrosa conspiración criminal.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </section>
        </main>
        <script>
            import '../scripts/personajes-animations.js'
        </script>
    </MainLayout>